{"name":"Caramel Sundae","hex":"#a9876a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"caramel","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A smooth, chewy, sticky confection made by heating sugar and other ingredients until the sugars polymerize and become sticky.","A (sometimes hardened) piece of this confection."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a yellow-brown color."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/caramel"},{"term":"sundae","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dessert consisting of ice cream with various toppings."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of soondae (“Korean dish made with intestines”)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sundae"}],"entries":[{"title":"Caramel","blocks":[{"text":"Caramel is a range of food ingredients made by heating sugars to high temperatures. It is used as a flavoring in puddings and desserts, as a filling in bonbons or candy bars, as a topping for ice cream and custard, and as a colorant commonly used in drinks."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Caramel-2.jpg/330px-Caramel-2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caramel"},{"title":"Sundae","blocks":[{"text":"A sundae is a frozen dessert that consists of ice cream topped with a sweet sauce or syrup. Its ice cream is typically scooped, and it typically has other toppings such as sprinkles, whipped cream, marshmallows, chocolate chips, M&M's, peanuts, cookies, chocolate brownies, maraschino cherries, or other fruits. It is of American origin."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/StrawberrySundae.jpg/330px-StrawberrySundae.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundae"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Caramels.jpg/500px-Caramels.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipe